obertura","es_actual":false,"elegida":true,"nombre":"Maíz con canavalia en primera, frijol en postrera y rastrojo en pie","nombre_en":"Maize with jack bean (canavalia) in primera, beans in postrera and standing stubble","nombre_corto":"maíz con canavalia","nombre_corto_en":"maize with jack bean","puntajes":{"agua":81,"suelo":100,"plagas":90},"deficit":{"mediana_pct":15,"p25_pct":11,"p75_pct":19,"perdida_mediana_pct":18},"meses_cultivo":[5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"meses_desnudos":[4],"quema":false,"toca_canicula":true,"beneficios":["La canavalia y el rastrojo cubren el suelo en la época seca.","La canavalia es leguminosa: aporta nitrógeno y materia orgánica.","Sin quema, el suelo guarda más humedad y se lava menos, como recomienda la Mesa Técnica Agroclimática de Chiquimula.","Suelo cubierto y cero quema son también la base de Kuxur Rum («mi tierra húmeda» en ch'orti'), el sistema que FAO y el MAGA promovieron en Chiquimula."],"beneficios_en":["Jack bean and stubble cover the soil in the dry season.","Jack bean is a legume: it adds nitrogen and organic matter.","Without burning, the soil keeps more moisture and washes away less, as the Chiquimula Agroclimatic Technical Board recommends.","Covered soil and no burning are also the basis of Kuxur Rum (“my humid land” in Ch'orti'), the system FAO and MAGA promoted in Chiquimula."],"riesgos":["Siembre la canavalia junto con el maíz o hasta unas dos semanas después, como indica ICTA, y vigile que no le haga sombra al maíz.","En un ensayo de CIMMYT en San Juan Ermita, el primer año dejar de quemar no subió la cosecha: el beneficio es de mediano plazo.","Dejar el rastrojo en pie choca con la costumbre de pastorear o quemar: hay que acordarlo con la familia."],"riesgos_en":["Sow the jack bean together with the maize or up to about two weeks later, as ICTA advises, and make sure it does not shade the maize.","In a CIMMYT trial in San Juan Ermita, stopping burning did not raise the harvest in the first year: the benefit is medium term.","Leaving stubble standing clashes with the habit of grazing or burning: it has to be agreed with the family."],"fuente":"ICTA, Boletín octubre 2022 «Abonos verdes», p. 3 (maíz asociado con canavalia); MAGA, Mesa Técnica Agroclimática de Chiquimula, boletín 21, 2025, p. 9 (cobertura y no quema); CIMMYT, Menú tecnológico maíz y frijol en el Oriente de Guatemala, 2024, p. 4; FAO, sistema agroforestal Kuxur Rum en Chiquimula","curva_agua":{"cultivo":"maiz","nombre_cultivo":"maíz","nombre_cultivo_en":"maize","siembra":"05-25","dias":125,"etapa_media":[56,95],"canicula":[22,99],"reserva_suelo_mm":50.0,"lluvia_efectiva_pct":80,"anios":{"tipico":{"puntos":[[1,0.6,1.6,1.6],[6,19.1,9.1,9.1],[11,36.0,16.4,16.4],[16,87.7,23.3,23.3],[21,111.2,30.5,30.5],[26,172.9,38.0,38.0],[31,211.5,47.4,47.4],[36,229.3,58.9,58.9],[41,230.9,74.2,74.2],[46,256.8,90.6,90.6],[51,290.9,109.6,109.6],[56,295.9,130.8,130.8],[61,333.7,154.7,154.7],[66,362.7,177.6,177.6],[71,366.6,199.5,199.5],[76,366.6,223.5,211.6],[81,416.2,247.5,226.5],[86,420.9,271.2,250.1],[91,427.7,294.2,260.5],[96,455.2,317.0,282.5],[101,477.5,338.4,290.7],[106,574.5,355.9,308.2],[111,587.0,372.0,324.2],[116,598.2,384.4,336.7],[121,667.2,394.6,346.9],[125,683.2,400.4,352.7]],"demanda_mm":400.4,"usada_mm":352.7,"deficit_pct":12,"anio":2002},"dificil":{"puntos":[[1,5.2,1.4,1.4],[6,14.0,8.8,8.8],[11,38.4,14.7,14.7],[16,79.1,20.3,20.3],[21,127.9,25.9,25.9],[26,195.2,33.0,33.0],[31,233.4,43.2,43.2],[36,257.1,55.2,55.2],[41,261.8,70.1,70.1],[46,261.8,86.5,86.5],[51,262.7,106.7,101.8],[56,263.5,128.9,102.4],[61,265.4,154.9,103.9],[66,269.5,179.7,107.3],[71,304.5,201.9,129.1],[76,327.8,223.9,149.5],[81,329.4,248.0,155.2],[86,352.1,270.4,173.1],[91,375.4,291.8,187.1],[96,380.1,314.6,195.7],[101,423.8,336.5,217.6],[106,443.1,354.6,235.7],[111,487.1,370.6,251.8],[116,495.1,383.2,264.3],[121,535.9,393.3,274.4],[125,549.9,398.9,280.1]],"demanda_mm":398.9,"usada_mm":280.1,"deficit_pct":30,"anio":2018}}}},{"id":"leguminosa_milpa","tipo":"leguminosa_cobertura","es_actual":false,"elegida":false,"nombre":"Milpa completa: maíz, frijol y ayote en primera, frijol en postrera y rastrojo en pie","nombre_en":"Full milpa: maize, beans and squash in primera, beans in postrera and standing stubble","nombre_corto":"milpa completa","nombre_corto_en":"full milpa","puntajes":{"agua":81,"suelo":100,"plagas":90},"deficit":{"mediana_pct":15,"p25_pct":11,"p75_pct":19,"perdida_mediana_pct":18},"meses_cultivo":[5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"meses_desnudos":[2,3,4],"quema":false,"toca_canicula":true,"beneficios":["El ayote cubre el suelo entre el maíz y frena la erosión en la temporada de lluvia.","Tres cultivos en la misma parcela reparten el riesgo: si uno falla, quedan los otros.","Suelo cubierto y cero quema son también la base de Kuxur Rum («mi tierra húmeda» en ch'orti'), el sistema que FAO y el MAGA promovieron en Chiquimula."],"beneficios_en":["Squash covers the soil between the maize and slows erosion in the rainy season.","Three crops in the same plot spread the risk: if one fails, the others remain.","Covered soil and no burning are also the basis of Kuxur Rum (“my humid land” in Ch'orti'), the system FAO and MAGA promoted in Chiquimula."],"riesgos":["El ayote necesita espacio: con mucha densidad de maíz compite por luz.","Dejar el rastrojo en pie choca con la costumbre de pastorear o quemar: hay que acordarlo con la familia."],"riesgos_en":["Squash needs space: with dense maize it competes for light.","Leaving stubble standing clashes with the habit of grazing or burning: it has to be agreed with the family."],"fuente":"MAGA, Mesa Técnica Agroclimática de Chiquimula, boletín 21, 2025, p. 9 («Rotar cultivos o policultivos como por ejemplo ayote, maíz y frijol»); FAO, sistema agroforestal Kuxur Rum en Chiquimula","curva_agua":{"cultivo":"maiz","nombre_cultivo":"maíz","nombre_cultivo_en":"maize","siembra":"05-25","dias":125,"etapa_media":[56,95],"canicula":[22,99],"reserva_suelo_mm":50.0,"lluvia_efectiva_pct":80,"anios":{"t