ca seca y protege el suelo.","Suelo cubierto y cero quema son también la base de Kuxur Rum («mi tierra húmeda» en ch'orti'), el sistema que FAO y el MAGA promovieron en Chiquimula."],"beneficios_en":["Pigeon pea is a deep-rooted legume shrub that stays green after the rains stop.","It gives grain and fodder in the dry season and protects the soil.","Covered soil and no burning are also the basis of Kuxur Rum (“my humid land” in Ch'orti'), the system FAO and MAGA promoted in Chiquimula."],"riesgos":["El gandul ocupa la parcela varios meses: se pierde la postrera de frijol.","Hay que protegerlo del ganado en la época seca."],"riesgos_en":["Pigeon pea occupies the plot for several months: the bean postrera is lost.","It has to be protected from livestock in the dry season."],"fuente":"ICTA, Boletín octubre 2022 «Abonos verdes», p. 4 (mucuna, gandul y frijol cachito se adaptan al corredor seco); FAO, sistema agroforestal Kuxur Rum en Chiquimula","curva_agua":{"cultivo":"maiz","nombre_cultivo":"maíz","nombre_cultivo_en":"maize","siembra":"05-25","dias":125,"etapa_media":[56,95],"canicula":[22,99],"reserva_suelo_mm":50.0,"lluvia_efectiva_pct":80,"anios":{"tipico":{"puntos":[[1,0.2,2.0,2.0],[6,12.4,10.3,10.3],[11,19.3,18.5,18.5],[16,82.3,26.0,26.0],[21,130.9,33.2,33.2],[26,169.1,40.8,40.8],[31,232.2,50.7,50.7],[36,285.2,62.2,62.2],[41,312.0,76.9,76.9],[46,354.6,92.7,92.7],[51,374.6,111.5,111.5],[56,380.0,133.9,133.9],[61,408.9,155.6,155.6],[66,450.0,176.7,176.7],[71,452.4,198.8,198.8],[76,480.2,223.6,223.6],[81,492.0,245.9,241.3],[86,513.1,268.3,258.2],[91,540.0,291.4,279.7],[96,550.3,313.8,286.1],[101,591.6,335.8,308.2],[106,662.8,354.4,326.8],[111,691.7,371.7,344.0],[116,713.3,384.4,356.7],[121,788.5,394.4,366.8],[125,818.3,400.9,373.3]],"demanda_mm":400.9,"usada_mm":373.3,"deficit_pct":7,"anio":2024},"dificil":{"puntos":[[1,1.0,1.5,1.5],[6,2.0,8.8,8.8],[11,15.9,15.2,15.2],[16,45.9,21.1,21.1],[21,135.2,26.7,26.7],[26,146.8,33.3,33.3],[31,146.8,43.2,43.2],[36,146.8,55.2,5